# Build context for the NestJS images (context = repository root,
# infra/docker/nest-service.Dockerfile). Allowlist: only the Nx workspace
# sources reach the daemon, so docs, PDFs/DOCX, labs/, tmp/, logs/, .worktrees/,
# .git, .nx, dist/, frontend/ and every .env file stay out by construction.
# The web image uses its own context (frontend/) and ignore file
# (infra/docker/web.Dockerfile.dockerignore).
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!nx.json
!tsconfig.base.json
!apps/
!libs/

# Never send nested artefacts or secrets, even from inside the allowlisted dirs.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.nx
**/.swc
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/tmp
**/logs
**/*.md
**/*.pdf
**/*.docx
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.tsbuildinfo
